# Ory Admin Panel

⚠️ **Work in progress — not stable yet.**

Admin UI for Ory, built with Next.js 16, React 19, Tailwind 4, Zod, React Hook Form, and TanStack Query.

## Quick start

```bash
make install
make dev
```

Open http://localhost:9000

## Docker

```bash
make docker-build
make docker-run
```

## Checks

```bash
make lint
make typecheck
make all
```
